{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Yes, Your Grace: Snowfall\u00a0</i>is a cinematic kingdom management game. Take on the role of a King, manage resources, support your loved ones, and make difficult decisions to see your kingdom prosper or fail. Dive into a Slavic-folklore inspired world and deal with a queue of petitioners who will bring trouble, help, or laughter into your throne room. Decide whether to help them with their problems, or conserve resources for more important matters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373090/extras/79963c3788903012f83e8eb344360922.poster.avif?t=1755778104\" width=620 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373090/extras/79963c3788903012f83e8eb344360922.webm?t=1755778104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tend to petitioners</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance your resources wisely to help those truly in need. Send your agents to aid the petitioners and decide who receives valuables from your treasury. As a Royal Monarch, you may demand taxes and pass laws but tread carefully, as each decision bears consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373090/extras/fb5fc8e58a13a4cdad2680eb6a6e43a7.webp?t=1755778104\" width=635 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire Agents</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each agent brings a unique and invaluable skill set, alongside their distinctive personalities. While they can aid in resolving courtly matters, be wary\u2014some may stir trouble with personal or romantic entanglements. Follow the agents\u2019 stories, assisting them in resolving complex dilemmas, as you carefully select who will stand by your side in the impending war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373090/extras/1e61e337e6eb0ca10796aa3017f96ff3.poster.avif?t=1755778104\" width=620 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373090/extras/1e61e337e6eb0ca10796aa3017f96ff3.webm?t=1755778104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Care for your family</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your children grow as you try to keep the kingdom together. Taking care of your family will always take precedence - after all, their support can be the strongest pillar in rebuilding the safe home Davern once was.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373090/extras/fb5fc8e58a13a4cdad2680eb6a6e43a7.webp?t=1755778104\" width=635 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373090/extras/d28359a25b7362173f19d28fe784c96b.poster.avif?t=1755778104\" width=620 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373090/extras/d28359a25b7362173f19d28fe784c96b.webm?t=1755778104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373090/extras/54e3e93da9abe9f4e788765fe920ca04.webp?t=1755778104\" width=635 height=17 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"My apologies.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1373090/4265cb473a5653e34babba85574ef2f080b43e1f.jpg"},{"name":"A lovely bunch.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1373090/4265cb473a5653e34babba85574ef2f080b43e1f.jpg"},{"name":"I\u2019ve got this.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1373090/4265cb473a5653e34babba85574ef2f080b43e1f.jpg"},{"name":"Snowfall.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1373090/4265cb473a5653e34babba85574ef2f080b43e1f.jpg"},{"name":"I will show you.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1373090/4265cb473a5653e34babba85574ef2f080b43e1f.jpg"},{"name":"Morana.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1373090/4265cb473a5653e34babba85574ef2f080b43e1f.jpg"},{"name":"He had it coming.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1373090/4265cb473a5653e34babba85574ef2f080b43e1f.jpg"},{"name":"Hide and seek.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1373090/4265cb473a5653e34babba85574ef2f080b43e1f.jpg"},{"name":"A Davernian always pays her debts.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1373090/4265cb473a5653e34babba85574ef2f080b43e1f.jpg"},{"name":"You shall do as I say.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1373090/4265cb473a5653e34babba85574ef2f080b43e1f.jpg"}],"total":36},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1373090?t=1755778104","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373090/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755778104","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373090/f3571591be430